Hum's source code has no third-party dependencies. Hum does not include any symbol sets. A parent can
search two free symbol libraries online; a symbol they choose is saved into their own tile. Those
symbols keep their own licences:

- ARASAAC pictograms by Sergio Palao. Origin: ARASAAC (https://arasaac.org). Licence: CC BY-NC-SA 4.0.
  Owner: Government of Aragón (Spain). Non-commercial: a paid or commercial fork of Hum must remove
  the ARASAAC search.
- Mulberry Symbols by Steve Lee (https://mulberrysymbols.org), via Global Symbols
  (https://globalsymbols.com). Licence: CC BY-SA 4.0.

